<p>Points: 88</p>
<p># Comments: 25</p>
]]></description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:44:22 +0000</pubDate><link>http://themouseless.dev/vim/</link><dc:creator>thanato0s</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50655868</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50655868</guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tell HN: Happy Thanksgiving]]></title><description><![CDATA[
